{"overview":"تیم مستندسازی که شاخهٔ اسکرانتون شرکت Dunder Mifflin را به‌ابدیت رسانده‌اند، به‌دنبال موضوع جدیدی می‌گردند و روزنامهٔ تاریخی تولیدو به نام «The Truth Teller» و ناشر مشتاقی که می‌خواهد آن را احیا کند، کشف می‌کنند.","tagline":"","overview_en":"The documentary crew that immortalized Dunder Mifflin's Scranton branch is in search of a new subject when they discover a historic Toledo newspaper, The Truth Teller, and the eager publisher trying to revive it.","tagline_en":"Finally some good news.","runtime":null,"status":"Returning Series","seasons":[{"n":1,"name":"فصل 1","ep":10,"y":2025,"poster":"/ySA5MvhoxTdezNUMe0ifPmhxH4w.jpg"},{"n":2,"name":"فصل 2","ep":10,"y":2026,"poster":"/16ybhI5uh6u68gyCBQocj8LPuFd.jpg"}],"episodes":20,"crew":["Michael Koman","گرگ دنیلز"],"crew_en":["Michael Koman","Greg Daniels"],"countries":["US"],"cast":[{"name":"دامنل گلیسون","role":"Ned Sampson","photo":"/a63BgOBKzJ9XPaLFyu7u5Ge3REG.jpg","en":"Domhnall Gleeson"},{"name":"Sabrina Impacciatore","role":"Esmeralda Grand","photo":"/ncgFgR7ZvXw2aBWnlHSGBtOfp15.jpg"},{"name":"Chelsea Frei","role":"Mare Pritti","photo":"/pjZlTBba5osblt12xWoMj3YzNrv.jpg"},{"name":"Melvin Gregg","role":"Detrick Moore","photo":"/tIeYOezPPBpUmVuzYO7idcWPuUz.jpg"},{"name":"Gbemisola Ikumelo","role":"Adelola Olofin","photo":"/cQaVvpCkBM3vaO7iE8YPSCV6yCM.jpg"},{"name":"Alex Edelman","role":"Adam Cooper","photo":"/dBWmHCZ7sTh3JyWmVDYgNaEuV06.jpg"},{"name":"Ramona Young","role":"Nicole Lee","photo":"/3ZVDaqAKw3wjXBnT62FZn1hbock.jpg"},{"name":"Tim Key","role":"Ken Davies","photo":"/5qaZxWpm3lXDbngjZJvnSbVS9I0.jpg"},{"name":"اسکار نونز","role":"Oscar Martinez","photo":"/UBILHiRphJdlshvsyH920QSAhk.jpg","en":"Oscar Nuñez"},{"name":"Eric Rahill","role":"Travis Bienlien","photo":"/zJGmDvV5avrr9cta8wkdkU7irRu.jpg"},{"name":"Duane R. Shepard Sr.","role":"Barry Strokes","photo":"/jSde1OY1EVDivOlAs7sJHqiBlkL.jpg"}],"trailer":"c5v4LJJkvUU","watch":{"US":{"link":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/253941-the-paper/watch?locale=U